# GS19: from the kolima_grind save (Kolima Forest's entrance; continue with vale_day1_continue.keys + --flash-in).
# The entrance: north-east over the bridge to the river log's east side (23,19), walking west rolls it to the bank where
# it tips into the river (KolimaForestEntrance_PushLog; its cells become ground); over it (20,17) and north to the north
# log (15,8): walking west rolls it one cell (stopped by a stump); round it by row 5 and west through the stumps to the
# glade exit (0,8; a battle on the way). The glade (f5132, cursed colours): walking west rolls the east log three cells
# (23,22 -> column 19); round by the south to 8,23 (centred), DOWN rolls the west-east log a row south, which opens
# column 10; north through the stumps (10,24 -> 9,18 -> 9,13), east and north to the cliff exit (19,1): Kolima Forest's
# cliff (f10000). Battles by autowalk's A taps; routes found with tests/probes/hpath.cjs.
